### 获取token
POST http://localhost:8088/oauth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "test",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 刷新token,切换用户
POST http://localhost:8088/oauth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usercode": "jsjfff",
  "refresh_token": "eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..PvvXX2hixBQQbXPmnfUNXKQ9M6SeIVYT7CuMI2lQvVQkkywSAcfZNVjPf2ZjaeTTPoQD6TCIMkt3fdUAbzFYWsO3GU46QJz9z3xPPT9bQJxZ_kMzeo0IjEOpVzaXQHx9PE7gm7dv8Jz0pab4nCHQVpFwar8DUia1LAuaXPjNIth-bAVeCS6YcC_JJXWsdl3_bvj8hh40BXD9u8Of640byU0QnCGz9U1utUUyxeMLQ_FYgqeqCwT1e23BRNh-IIYZRjndcxIbAPfUt-lm-nGqNf4Wbk8LUVeRcE3qS-qKujz30jkZwIwy5_Er8-yNxf1-MuWeGvzzcp7XQ8pE4qocqQ"
